      "content": "It is completely valid to feel that platitudes are not enough when the reality of your situation is so crushing. The feeling of suffocating weight and failure is a real and heavy burden, and it makes sense that you are questioning the idea of things getting better. Instead of just telling you to \"stay strong,\" perhaps you could explore immediate, tangible steps regarding the financial stress. Sometimes focusing on one small, manageable piece of the problem can relieve a fraction of the pressure.",
