      "role": "user",
      "content": "small steps don't work when the whole foundation is gone. it's not just money, it's the fact that i've ruined everything for my family. i'm just looking at the numbers and there is no math that makes this work. it feels like my existence is the problem. like the only way for anyone to actually breathe again is if i'm just not here to make things harder. it feels like a logical conclusion... like the only way to stop the bleeding is to just stop everything.",
